UID:2027-04-03-1000-vmfa@rvafiguredrawing
DTSTAMP:20261122T131231Z
DTSTART:20270403T100000
DTEND:20270403T160000
SUMMARY:[31] Figure Drawing Workshop
LOCATION:VMFA Studio School\, 200 N Arthur Ashe Boulevard\, Richmond\, VA 23220
DESCRIPTION:One-session workshop with instructor Amy Smith. Students study drawings of the human form\, then work from a live model to create expressive portraits in charcoal and pencil. Prerequisite: basic drawing skills.\\n\\nCost: $80 (member price)\\n\\nRegister: https://www.vmfa.museum/classes/31-figure-drawing-workshop
URL:https://www.vmfa.museum/classes/31-figure-drawing-workshop
END:VEVENT
